      "cooked": "<p>If I am playing Omnitron-X, and I play Slip Through Time early in the game, before I get a second power, can I use my base Timeshift power a second time?&nbsp; It seems from the rules that I probably can't, but it's just uncertain enough that I'd like to hear confirmation one way or the other.</p>",
