      "created_at": "2013-12-06T21:19:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just to clarify, each \"instance\" of a power can only be used once per turn.</p><p>Use OmnitronX for example. If he had two copies of Bio-Engineering Beam in play, he could use them both on the same turn when combined with Slip Through Time.</p>",
